According to the W02-S04, the following staff need to check in:

Provisional staffing: analyst 24 hours across days 1–8; 
Engineering 12 hours, no earlier than day 4; 
QA 8 hours during days 5–7; 
Operations 4 hours across days 1 and 8. 
These hours require confirmation after authorization.

Also Elias mentions that staff already have their regular duties so their availability needs to be confirmed before being authorized.
